{"id":"a8dc1e9d-82c2-44c1-a924-7321f0565e55","title":"Slide and Shift 1","slug":"slide-and-shift-1","collectionSlug":"slide-and-shift","collectionName":"Slide and Shift","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A pixelated shader effect displaying a blocky, low-resolution aesthetic with a dithered color palette. The image features a stark contrast between two dominant colors: a soft, warm beige/cream (#ede7c0) and a muted, cool periwinkle blue (#8cb3de). The composition shows rectangular blocks of varying sizes arranged in an abstract, non-representational pattern across the canvas. A Bayer2 dithering pattern creates a characteristic checkerboard texture within each colored block, giving the entire image a retro, 8-bit computer graphics appearance. The pixelation effect with a 16-pixel scale creates hard-edged geometric shapes. Grid distortion with moderate intensity (2.3) subtly warps the block boundaries, creating slight irregularities in what would otherwise be perfectly aligned rectangles. A vignette effect with black falloff (radius 0.5, falloff 1.05) darkens the edges of the composition, drawing focus toward the center. The overall mood is nostalgic and digital, reminiscent of early computer graphics or pixel art. The color distribution is relatively balanced, with the beige occupying the central and lower portions while blue dominates the upper and right edges. The dithering creates a granular, textured surface quality despite the blocky structure.","colors":["#8cb3de","#ede7c0","#ffffff","#000000"],"labels":["geometric","textured","retro"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/a8dc1e9d-82c2-44c1-a924-7321f0565e55.jpg","toneMapping":"cineon","components":[{"type":"BlockNoise","id":"idmvk9m67thm60tqcar","_key":"key_mvk9m67thm60tqcar","props":{"seed":84,"scale":1.5,"speed":0.2,"stops":[{"color":"#ffffff","position":0},{"color":"#000000","position":1}],"colorA":"#ffffff","colorB":"#000000","balance":0,"opacity":1,"contrast":4.5,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode